{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1345396-community","id":1345396,"title":"Community","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-11-01T23:27:31-07:00","id":1345396,"title":"Community","content":"I'm working on an idea for a Technocratic \u201cMinor Sphere\u201d that draws elements from Mind, Entropy, and Primal Utility. The idea is that this Sphere deals with corporate activity: Iteration X views it through the lens of the community as a well-oiled machine (Hari Seldon's Psychohistory from Asimov's Foundation series would fit right in with the Iteration X approach to this Sphere); the New World Order sees this as the Sphere of the Masses, applied sociology; the Progenitors think of it in terms of the ecology, and tend to do conjunctional Life/Community Effects; and the Syndicate understands it as market forces. (I'm not sure how the Void Engineers see it; its subject matter is something that they tend to leave to other Conventions to deal with.)<br /> <br /> The Community Sphere isn't really geared toward dealing with individuals; it's more effective when dealing with groups: it deals with interactions between people which means that you need at least two people before an Effect falls into its purview. On the other hand, its Effects tend to work better on \u201charmonious\u201d groups: internal strife and dissidents tend to degrade the effectiveness of Community; and the larger the group, the harder it is to root out internal strife. So in that regard, it tends to be self-limiting. <br /> <br /> I'm still thinking this through; but some of the Effects that I want this Sphere to have are Psychohistory-like predictive effects (Iteration X's main contribution); the ability to manipulate Reality Zones by influencing the local Consensus (the NWO's contribution); and a more general version of Primal Ventures (the Syndicate's contribution). I'm thinking that it might also have elements of communication and education in it. <br /> <br /> At this point, this is a very rough idea; I'm very much interested in help in refining it and turning it into a full Sphere write-up. <br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T10:08:35-08:00","id":1345604,"title":"","content":"Are you actually going to use this in a game, or is this just a mental exercise for you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}